PHASE 5: Upload the Video to Google Drive and Submit the Links

Step 1: Upload the Video

1. Open "Google Drive" (https://drive.google.com/).
2. Click New → File upload.
3. Select your recorded demo video.
4. Wait until the upload is complete.

Step 2: Create a Shareable Video Link

1. Locate the uploaded video in Google Drive.
2. Right-click the file and select Share.
3. Under General access, change Restricted to Anyone with the link, if permitted by your account or organization.
4. Set the access role to Viewer.
5. Click Copy link and save the link for submission.

Step 3: Submit the Project Links on SkillWallet

1. Open the SkillWallet portal and navigate to your project submission section.
2. Paste your Swift-Ship-Tracker GitHub repository link into the GitHub repository field.
3. Paste your Google Drive demo video link into the video URL field.
4. Double-check both links to ensure they are correct.
5. Click Submit.

Finally, verify that the portal displays the expected completion status. If the project status changes to 100% Completed, your submission is complete.

